摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Terminal-native interactive TUI for DeepSeek Harness (dsh) — built with Ink, React for terminals","id":"gh:1333301406","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"deepseek-harness-tui","slug":"gxinxing/deepseek-harness-tui","topics":["cli","deepseek","dsh-plugin","ink","react","terminal","tui"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Terminal-native interactive TUI for DeepSeek Harness (dsh) — built with Ink, React for terminals"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# deepseek-harness-tui"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"**An interactive terminal chat for DeepSeek Harness — terminal-native style, built with Ink (React f"},{"id":"p3s2","text":" terminal chat for DeepSeek Harness — terminal-native style, built with Ink (React for terminals).**"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"Give it a TokenDance key and a `dsh` install; run `dsh --profile tui` and you get a zero-chrome term"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"inal chat with DeepSeek models: bottom-anchored transcript, tool calls folded into cells, thinking f"},{"id":"p4s3","text":"olding, and a theme that adapts to your terminal via OSC 11. It's a thin, readable plugin (~800 line"},{"id":"p4s4","text":"s of UI) — not a re-implementation of the harness."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"English · 简体中文"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"Requires **Node.js ≥ 20** and the DeepSeek Harness CLI:"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"Wire the plugin bundle into the `tui` profile (one-time):"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"## Use"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"In the TUI: `ctrl + t` folds the thinking trace, `esc` interrupts the running turn, `/help` shows al"},{"id":"p13s2","text":"l keys and commands."},{"id":"p14s1","text":"## What it does"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"- **Terminal-native UI, not a re-skinned echo.** The transcript is the surface — no boxes, no chrome"},{"id":"p15s2","text":". The DeepSeek brand banner (ANSI Shadow logo, gradient) greets you only on the empty state; model ·"},{"id":"p15s3","text":" cwd live in a dim footer.\n- **Tool calls fold into cells.** `⠋ Running <cmd>` while active → `✓ <cm"},{"id":"p15s4","text":"d> • 1.2s` (or `✗` on error), with output merged into the cell, dimmed, and truncated head + tail (`"},{"id":"p15s5","text":"… +N lines`). No interleaved wall of raw output.\n- **Theme derived from your terminal.** OSC 11 prob"},{"id":"p15s6","text":"es the real background: message tints and code chips are blended from it (12% white over dark, 4% bl"},{"id":"p15s7","text":"ack over light) — never hardcoded hex. Force a theme with `DSH_TUI_BG=#ffffff` for testing.\n- **Thin"},{"id":"p15s8","text":"king you can fold.** `ctrl + t` toggles the reasoning trace; `esc` aborts the turn at any time via `"},{"id":"p15s9","text":"agent.cancel({ kind: 'user' })`.\n- **Markdown that keeps its shape.** Headers keep their `#`, fenced"},{"id":"p15s10","text":" blocks keep their fences, inline code gets a subtle chip — and CJK/emoji wrap at correct character "},{"id":"p15s11","text":"widths with an aligned gutter.\n- **A live viewport.** The transcript is bottom-anchored; the tail is"},{"id":"p15s12","text":" always visible. Busy state shows a braille spinner + compact elapsed timer (`Working 5s`)."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"## Learn more"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"- INTEGRATION-NOTES.md — event shapes, patch semantics, and the integration deep-dive (how `session/"},{"id":"p17s2","text":"event` maps to the UI)\n- DeepSeek Harness — the underlying agent framework\n- Model routing (TokenDan"},{"id":"p17s3","text":"ce) — gateway config, credentials, and the one-time tool-call guard"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"## Model routing (TokenDance)"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"The profile patch (`cordis.patch.yml`) routes `llm-deepseek` through the TokenDance gateway:"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"The provider is registered in `~/.dsh/settings.yaml` (`llm-pi-ai.providers.tokendance`): OpenAI-comp"},{"id":"p21s2","text":"atible endpoint, `thinkingFormat: deepseek`, models `deepseek-v4-flash` (default) and `deepseek-v4-p"},{"id":"p21s3","text":"ro`. Switch models by editing the provider's `models` list or overriding `llm-deepseek.model` in you"},{"id":"p21s4","text":"ls by editing the provider's `models` list or overriding `llm-deepseek.model` in your profile patch."},{"id":"p22s1","text":"> **Prerequisite fix (one-time, per dsh install).** TokenDance streams subsequent tool-call deltas w"},{"id":"p22s2","text":"ith empty `name`/`id`; the stock `@deepseek-ai/dsh-llm-deepseek` adapter overwrites the first frame'"},{"id":"p22s3","text":"s call id with `\"\"` and the harness loops on `unknown tool \"\"`. Apply the guard in `node_modules/@de"},{"id":"p22s4","text":"epseek-ai/dsh-llm-deepseek/lib/index.js`:\n>\n[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p23s1","text":">\n> Applied 2026-08-13 on this machine. The edit lives in the global dsh install and is **lost on `d"},{"id":"p23s2","text":"sh` upgrade** — re-apply after upgrading (worth an upstream PR)."},{"id":"p24s1","text":"## Self-inspection · Self-repair · Self-update loop"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"This project ships a complete automated quality gate — **inspect → repair → update — closed loop**:"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"### Local inspection"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"### Local self-repair"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"**On every `git commit`** (husky + lint-staged):\n- staged `*.js` files → `prettier --write` + `eslin"},{"id":"p31s2","text":"t --fix` before the commit lands\n- committed code is always clean — no manual `pnpm format` needed"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"### Dependency self-update"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"**GitHub Actions auto-runs** (`.github/workflows/deps.yml`):\n- Every Monday 06:00 UTC\n- Creates a `d"},{"id":"p34s2","text":"eps/auto-update-YYYYMMDD` branch + PR when updates exist\n- Manual trigger available from the GitHub "},{"id":"p34s3","text":"date-YYYYMMDD` branch + PR when updates exist\n- Manual trigger available from the GitHub Actions tab"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"### CI gate (`.github/workflows/ci.yml`)"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"| Trigger | Job | Matrix |"},{"id":"p37s1","text":"| `push` / `pull_request` to main | `inspect` | Node 20 + Node 22 |\n| | lint | ✅ |\n| | format:check "},{"id":"p37s2","text":"| ✅ |\n| | test (57 cases) | ✅ |\n| | coverage upload | Node 22 only |"},{"id":"p38s1","text":"Any stage failure blocks the merge — main is always green."},{"id":"p39s1","text":"## Contributing"},{"id":"p40s1","text":"Issues and PRs are welcome. Good first tasks: upstream the two runtime patches (TokenDance tool-call"},{"id":"p40s2","text":" guard, grep permission-error tolerance), add a screenshot for light themes, or port the welcome ban"},{"id":"p40s3","text":"ner to other model providers. See INTEGRATION-NOTES.md before touching the event bridge."},{"id":"p41s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p42s1","text":"MIT. An independent community project, not affiliated with DeepSeek or TokenDance."}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
